id: DRAFT-knewstuff-6-18-0-optional-i18nqml
draft: true
contributor_id: zxyAtom
title: Guard both linking and KLocalizedQmlContext use behind an optional KF6 I18nQml target
trigger_tool: cmake
phase: configure
error_signature: KF6::I18nQml|KLocalizedQmlContext|HAVE_KLOCALIZEDQMLCONTEXT
severity: medium
category: build_system,dependency_resolution
match_keywords: knewstuff,KF6::I18nQml,KLocalizedQmlContext,CMake,TARGET,optional,QML
root_cause: KNewStuff unconditionally linked and used KLocalizedQmlContext even when the optional KF6::I18nQml target was absent, so guarding only the link leaves C++ references that cannot compile.
affected_scope: KNewStuff 6.18.0 builds whose dependency graph does not export KF6::I18nQml while the dialog or widgets sources include KLocalizedQmlContext.
verification_cmd: conan create archives/k/knewstuff/6.18.0 -pr:h ohos-aarch64
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: couple-target-and-source-guards
rec_description: Use if(TARGET KF6::I18nQml) for the link, define a matching feature macro there, and compile-guard every KLocalizedQmlContext include, construction and use with that macro.
rec_command:
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: manual
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach:
fallback_description:
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix: false
fallback_impl:
forbid_1_pattern: guard only target_link_libraries.*KF6::I18nQml
forbid_1_reason: The C++ translation-context declarations and calls remain compiled when the CMake target is absent.
forbid_1_consequence: The optional dependency is removed from the link line but the sources still fail to compile.
principles:
causes:
caused_by:
similar_to:
conflicts_with:
prerequisite_of:
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-knewstuff-6-18-0-optional-i18nqml.md
last_updated: 2026-09-05
source_event: knewstuff/6.18.0 adaptation evidence at archives/k/knewstuff/6.18.0/reports/knowledge-evidence.md
authors: zxyAtom
source_pr: 7399
source_commit: d11e96035ea3a7f68d4a5d93623f38e65cc96a88
